Do not unregister from the portmapper in udp_done() with NO_PORTMAPPER.

udp_server() already skips the portmapper with NO_PORTMAPPER; udp_done()
still called pmap_unset(), which does not exist without Sun RPC (QNX).

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific

--- a/src/lib_udp.c
+++ b/src/lib_udp.c
@@ -51,7 +51,9 @@
 void
 udp_done(int prog)
 {
+#ifndef	NO_PORTMAPPER
 	(void)pmap_unset((u_long)prog, (u_long)1);
+#endif
 }
 
